  "_about": "Machine-applied classification rules for the deterministic auto-takeoff. Written from Martin's interview answers (2026-10-03/05) and the two manual tests (Valvoline, McLarty). Ordered: the first matching rule in each list wins. Patterns are case-insensitive regexes run on the item's description text (schedule description + table cells + legend row). Prose versions live in knowledge/system_knowledge_base.json.",
