  "detail_keywords": "STOREFRONT|STORE FRONT|CURTAIN ?WALL|WINDOW WALL|FRAMELESS GLASS|GLASS PARTITION|GLASS DOOR|GLAZING|SILL FLASHING|CLOSURE TRIM|CLOSURE TRMI|BREAK METAL|BRAKE METAL|BRK\\.? METAL|MIRROR|'?U'? ?CHANNEL|TEMPERED|ALUM(INUM|\\.)? (FRAME|SILL|HEAD|JAMB|WINDOW)|SPANDREL|MULLION|DBL\\.? ALUM|DOUBLE ALUM|GLASS",
